<title>SPAIN: Spain's Puleva-Uniasa posts Q1 pretax 672 mln ptas.</title>
<headline>Spain's Puleva-Uniasa posts Q1 pretax 672 mln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Spain's Puleva-Uniasa for the first quarter of 1997, in millions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Pretax profit			    672     vs	589</p>
<p> Net turnover			   6,002     vs    5,832</p>
<p> Operating profit			 330     vs	133</p>
<p> Ordinary profit			  438     vs	321</p>
</text>
